141: def auto_request(job, sec, min_overlap=3, secs=2.5):
142:     """Source Clip rung (visual ladder v2, right after stock): when the script didn't ask for source evidence, pick the
143:     source caption cue whose words best match this beat's narration -> a 2.5-second clip request, or None.
144:     Uses only real cue timestamps (never a guessed time); a weak match (< min_overlap shared content words) is skipped."""
